        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/68f093e75a4bce87028cf0544d96d67d.avif?t=1783175958\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>English translation planned in the roadmap after version 2.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game has already received a full year of regular updates, significantly enhancing its quality. We are now approaching the official release, which will include a full English translation. And more to come !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was made by a single dev with limited resources, so it may contain bugs and will not receive the same level of support as a big-budget game. Thank you for your understanding and have fun !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/d402b4f2d6e1cdf7a07955079e2115eb.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over <strong>80 talents across combinable classes</strong> to create your own unique build. The <strong>Mercenary, Necromancer, </strong>and<strong> Artisan</strong> will be your spearheads on your adventure, while the other classes must be unlocked with Radiant Gems, the game's premium currency, which can be farmed for free infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/66b2eba6b8647fdf64cc8a7d4fea46ce.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure through <strong>6 different dungeons</strong>, home to over <strong>20 unique monsters</strong>, including tougher elites and, if you're lucky, even <strong>mimics</strong> with exceptional loot. Enjoy a <strong>modernized turn-based combat</strong> system where attacks are automatic but skills must be cast manually. A perfect blend of idle and active gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☠️ Timing and strategy will be key to reaching the depths of Pandemonium. A randomly generated, <strong>infinite final raid</strong> featuring all the game's monsters awaits. Negative affixes will further increase the difficulty of this <strong>survival mode</strong>. New affix rotations will appear each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/1026e9beae1fe6405c4a3bb0f4bb37da.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to <strong>forge</strong> the best equipment. <strong>Synergize</strong> your arsenal of weapons, armor, and jewelry with your class talents to create unprecedented playstyles. Legendary weapons have unique effects and can be further enhanced beyond their limits in the endgame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/762473a783265454ffdf5677fa4d7c66.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress in four distinct professions: <strong>Mining, Lumberjacking, Herbalism, and Fishing</strong>. The first two will allow you to gather ores and wood to forge your equipment, while the latter two will let you create potions with increasingly fantastic effects. <i>For example, speed potions to instantly complete quests.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/60f1af6d735619969df4d4f373ec25a2.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests during dungeon battles or even in the background while the game is closed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idle aspect, reminiscent of  ​​older browser games, is fundamental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/d51058c55c3cdcb97d32f5a9cdb0addf.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alquiem doesn't end with just one playthrough</strong>. Once you reach the maximum level, you can choose to restart your adventure from scratch, or almost... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 The City Projects system lets you build your own medieval city, and its buildings offer permanent upgrades that are retained between playthroughs. Legacy Equipment is also retained, allowing you to make your early game much faster and more unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/6f477e6c8a15cbe9b9d47cc7c54fe98e.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alquiem is a <strong>100% free-to-play game</strong>. To fund future content updates, you have access to various microtransactions, ranging from simple cosmetics  to The Crusade: an extremely generous seasonal battle pass for free users that also includes a unique legendary skin and a large quantity of radiant gems once unlocked in its paid version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And that's just a brief summary; discover much more once you're in the game.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you all for your support, and have fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/68f093e75a4bce87028cf0544d96d67d.avif?t=1783175958\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>English translation planned in the roadmap after version 2.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game has already received a full year of regular updates, significantly enhancing its quality. We are now approaching the official release, which will include a full English translation. And more to come !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was made by a single dev with limited resources, so it may contain bugs and will not receive the same level of support as a big-budget game. Thank you for your understanding and have fun !</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/d402b4f2d6e1cdf7a07955079e2115eb.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over <strong>80 talents across combinable classes</strong> to create your own unique build. The <strong>Mercenary, Necromancer, </strong>and<strong> Artisan</strong> will be your spearheads on your adventure, while the other classes must be unlocked with Radiant Gems, the game's premium currency, which can be farmed for free infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/66b2eba6b8647fdf64cc8a7d4fea46ce.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure through <strong>6 different dungeons</strong>, home to over <strong>20 unique monsters</strong>, including tougher elites and, if you're lucky, even <strong>mimics</strong> with exceptional loot. Enjoy a <strong>modernized turn-based combat</strong> system where attacks are automatic but skills must be cast manually. A perfect blend of idle and active gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☠️ Timing and strategy will be key to reaching the depths of Pandemonium. A randomly generated, <strong>infinite final raid</strong> featuring all the game's monsters awaits. Negative affixes will further increase the difficulty of this <strong>survival mode</strong>. New affix rotations will appear each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/1026e9beae1fe6405c4a3bb0f4bb37da.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to <strong>forge</strong> the best equipment. <strong>Synergize</strong> your arsenal of weapons, armor, and jewelry with your class talents to create unprecedented playstyles. Legendary weapons have unique effects and can be further enhanced beyond their limits in the endgame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/762473a783265454ffdf5677fa4d7c66.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress in four distinct professions: <strong>Mining, Lumberjacking, Herbalism, and Fishing</strong>. The first two will allow you to gather ores and wood to forge your equipment, while the latter two will let you create potions with increasingly fantastic effects. <i>For example, speed potions to instantly complete quests.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/60f1af6d735619969df4d4f373ec25a2.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests during dungeon battles or even in the background while the game is closed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idle aspect, reminiscent of  ​​older browser games, is fundamental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/d51058c55c3cdcb97d32f5a9cdb0addf.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alquiem doesn't end with just one playthrough</strong>. Once you reach the maximum level, you can choose to restart your adventure from scratch, or almost... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 The City Projects system lets you build your own medieval city, and its buildings offer permanent upgrades that are retained between playthroughs. Legacy Equipment is also retained, allowing you to make your early game much faster and more unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142300/extras/6f477e6c8a15cbe9b9d47cc7c54fe98e.webp?t=1783175958\" width=548 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alquiem is a <strong>100% free-to-play game</strong>. To fund future content updates, you have access to various microtransactions, ranging from simple cosmetics  to The Crusade: an extremely generous seasonal battle pass for free users that also includes a unique legendary skin and a large quantity of radiant gems once unlocked in its paid version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And that's just a brief summary; discover much more once you're in the game.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you all for your support, and have fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
